</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bfb80294-793e-11f1-a879-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/JCG-Takuy%C5%8D-HL-02.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bfb80294-793e-11f1-a879-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/JCG-Takuy%C5%8D-HL-02.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">90a6d83a-793a-11f1-a837-836db58cffca</guid><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 13:30:03 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>东京特约记者 楚良一</dc:creator></item><item><category>今日经济</category><title>保护经济为由 中国阻止人工智能人才外流</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E/20260706-%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E4%B8%BA%E7%94%B1-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%98%BB%E6%AD%A2%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BA%BA%E6%89%8D%E5%A4%96%E6%B5%81</link><description>
